Psst.
Hey you.
You're a human right?
- Why can I understand you?
	label MainPath
	I've studied all about your species.
	I'm the only one here who can understand what you're saying. Everyone else speaks Yokai Standard.
	label Info
	Any questions?
	- How do I get outta here?
		I believe there is a portal that goes back to Earth. But you need a password for the door.
		I can't really remember it but I'm sure some Yokai here would know.
		All I know is it is 4 words.
		jump Info
	- What is this place?
		This is the Spirit Auction. 
		We meet once every few hundred years and have an auction. 
		We find some interesting things and bid on them. 
		What? 
		You think that's weird?
		The proceeds go to charity so keep your judgement to yourself. 
		jump Info
	- I'm good. 
		Cool. Oh yeah. If you don't get back to your home before the auction ends, you'll be stuck here until the next auction. 
		That will be in... about 240 years. 
		That's pretty soon though.
		Hm? You don't live that long? 
		Wow. Only 80 years if you're lucky?
		That's rough. I would find the portal if I were you. 
		You should take this with you. It's the second part of a dictionary series I used to learn your language. 
		You can use the translations to help you communicate with some of the others. 
- Says who?
	Hey hey, take it easy man. I was just curious. 
	jump MainPath